  <title>How to Remove Author Name from a PDF (2026) — Every Method | FileIntel</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Your name is hidden inside every PDF you send. Here is how to remove the Author field permanently — in your browser, via command line, or in Acrobat — before it reaches the wrong eyes." />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://fileintel.me/blog/remove-author-from-pdf" />
