        <button class="demo-action-btn" onclick="resetDemo()">Reset</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p>See what just happened above. The Info dictionary and the XMP stream both held the name. Both needed to be cleared. A tool that only touches the Info dictionary would leave the XMP entry intact.</p>

    <!-- MID-ARTICLE CTA -->
    <div class="article-cta">
      <div>
