          </ol>
          <p style="margin-top:10px; font-size:12.5px; color:var(--accent);">&#9888; This only clears the Info dictionary. The XMP stream may still contain your name. Verify with ExifTool after.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="os-card">
        <div class="os-card-header">
          <div class="os-icon">&#128274;</div>
          <div>
            <div class="os-name">Sanitize Document</div>
